     A*========================================================================
     A* File:        BOOKERRP.PRTF
     A* Programmer:  Chris Grimm
     A* Date:        11/19/2026
     A*
     A* Description:
     A*     External DDS Printer File for BOOKIMPORT exception and audit
     A*     report. Prints report headers, skipped CSV line details,
     A*     rejection reasons, and batch summary totals.
     A*
     A* Maintenance Log:
     A* Date       Author       Description
     A* ---------- ------------ -----------------------------------------------
     A* 11/19/2026 Chris Grimm  Initial printer file creation.
     A*========================================================================
     A          R RPTHEADER                 SKIPB(3)
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A                                     2'PROGRAM: BOOKIMPORT'
     A                                    48'LIBRARY CATALOG IMPORT AUDIT'
     A                                   108'DATE:'
     A                                   114DATE EDTCDE(Y)
     A          R RPTSUBHDR                 SPACEA(2)
     A                                     2'SOURCE: Books.csv (IFS)'
     A                                   108'PAGE:'
     A                                   114PAGNBR EDTCDE(Z)
     A          R COLHEADER                 SPACEA(1)
     A                                     2'LINE #'
     A                                    12'REJECTION REASON'
     A                                    48'RAW CSV DATA SNIPPET'
     A          R COLUNDER                  SPACEA(1)
     A                                     2'--------'
     A                                    12'----------------------------------'
     A                                    48'----------------------------------'
     A                                    82'----------------------------------'
     A          R DETAIL                    SPACEA(1)
     A            PRTLINENUM     7S 0      2EDTCDE(Z)
     A            PRTREASON     34A       12
     A            PRTRAWDATA    82A       48
     A          R NOERRORS                  SPACEB(2)
     A                                    12'*** ALL RECORDS IMPORTED CLEANLY'
     A                                    45'- ZERO ERRORS DETECTED ***'
     A          R RPTSUMMARY                SPACEB(2)
     A                                     2'----------------------------------'
     A                                    36'----------------------------------'
     A                                    70'----------------------------------'
     A                                   104'--------------'
     A          R RPTOTALS                  SPACEB(1)
     A                                     2'TOTAL RECORDS LOADED:'
     A            PRTLOADED      7S 0     25EDTCDE(J)
     A                                    40'TOTAL RECORDS SKIPPED:'
     A            PRTSKIPPED     7S 0     64EDTCDE(J)
